# Stylized Mesh Toolkit (V33+)

When adding or updating stylized world geometry:

- Use `StylizedMeshToolkit` builders in `scripts/environment/stylized/mesh/`
- Do **not** use raw `BoxMesh`, `CylinderMesh`, or `TorusMesh` as final visible hero geometry when a toolkit builder fits
- Keep irregularity subtle (0.05–0.15) and seed-deterministic
- See `docs/V33_STYLIZED_MESH_TOOLKIT.md`
